; A3 - resistor temperature coefficients, at netlist level.
;
; A divider whose top resistor carries TC1/TC2 and whose bottom one does not, driven by a 1 V
; source. The node voltage is then Rbot / (Rtop(T) + Rbot), which is a closed form the test
; computes for itself - so the fixture proves the coefficients reached the stamp, not that two
; copies of the same code agree.
temp = 125

Vdc:V1  in 0  Vdc=1
R:Rtop  in mid  R=1000 TC1=5e-3 TC2=1e-6 Tnom=25
R:Rbot  mid 0   R=1000
